<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Physics News Template</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
        .header-title { font-size: 36pt; font-weight: bold; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 12pt; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .section-heading { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .sub-heading { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .body-text { font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        td { padding: 8px 0; }
        .signature-block { margin-top: 30px; }
        .contact-info { font-size: 10pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="header-title">Physics News</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Michigan Tech Physics Department Newsletter</div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <div>
            <div class="section-heading">A note from the Chair</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                By <span data-field="chair_name">{{ chair_name }}</span><br>
                <span data-field="chair_title">{{ chair_title }}</span>
                <br><br>
                <span data-field="chair_message">{{ chair_message }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 200px; text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Chair Photo" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Current Research:</div>
            <div class="section-heading">Dr. Ravi Pandey</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="research_summary">{{ research_summary }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%; text-align: center;">
            <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Research Photo" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="section-heading">Faculty, Students, and Alumni:</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="faculty_alumni_update">{{ faculty_alumni_update }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Current Research:</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="current_research_detail">{{ current_research_detail }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">View our Physics Brochure</div>
            <div class="body-text" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
                <a href="http://www.mtu.edu/depts/physics/index.html">http://www.mtu.edu/depts/physics/index.html</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Winter Quarter 1998-99 Course Offerings</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>PH010 Development of Physics skills</p>
                <p>PH020 Team Approach Learning Physics</p>
                <p>PH181 Introductory Physics Lab 1</p>
                <p>PH182 Introductory Physics Lab 2</p>
                <p>PH183 Introductory Physics Lab 3</p>
                <p>PH201 Elements of Physics I</p>
                <p>PH202 Elements of Physics II</p>
                <p>PH204 General Physics I</p>
                <p>PH205 General Physics II</p>
                <p>PH206 General Physics III</p>
                <p>PH332 Theoretical Mechanics I</p>
                <p>PH337 Electronics for Scientists II</p>
                <p>PH412 Senior Laboratory/Project</p>
                <p>PH421 Quantum Mechanics II</p>
                <p>PH426 Electricity and Magnetism</p>
                <p>PH430 Stellar Astrophysics</p>
                <p>PH452 Senior Physics Colloquium</p>
                <p>PH470 Solid-state Physics</p>
                <p>PH490 Concepts in Physics: Experiment and Analysis</p>
                <p>PH490 Classical Mechanics in Physics</p>
                <p>PH500 Graduate Research</p>
                <p>PH510 Classical Mechanics</p>
                <p>PH511 Electrodynamics</p>
                <p>PH524 Mathematical Physics II</p>
                <p>PH561 Gen. Relativity</p>
                <p>PH600 Doctoral Research</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Thanks!</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="thanks_message">{{ thanks_message }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="signature-block">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Garry C. Antler</p>
                        <p><span data-field="antler_title">{{ antler_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Pamela A. Croy</p>
                        <p><span data-field="croy_title">{{ croy_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Don J. Gendzwill</p>
                        <p><span data-field="gendzwill_title">{{ gendzwill_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Ronald S. Huribut</p>
                        <p><span data-field="huribut_title">{{ huribut_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Kenneth J. Javor</p>
                        <p><span data-field="javor_title">{{ javor_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Jon H. Macleod</p>
                        <p><span data-field="macleod_title">{{ macleod_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Kevin C. Nickolaus</p>
                        <p><span data-field="nickolaus_title">{{ nickolaus_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Harold W. Paul</p>
                        <p><span data-field="paul_title">{{ paul_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Thomas M. Plutchak</p>
                        <p><span data-field="plutchak_title">{{ plutchak_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Mary J. Repar</p>
                        <p><span data-field="repar_title">{{ repar_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Raymond E. Schramm</p>
                        <p><span data-field="schramm_title">{{ schramm_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Xiachin Shi</p>
                        <p><span data-field="shi_title">{{ shi_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Gary J. Shiflett</p>
                        <p><span data-field="shiflett_title">{{ shiflett_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Richard V. Spigarelli</p>
                        <p><span data-field="spigarelli_title">{{ spigarelli_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
                    <div>
                        <p>Stephen M. Stewart</p>
                        <p><span data-field="stewart_title">{{ stewart_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>Michael B. Teneyck</p>
                        <p><span data-field="teneyck_title">{{ teneyck_title }}</span></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Department Update</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="dept_update_content">{{ dept_update_content }}</span>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 30px; text-align: center;">
                <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Department Photo" style="width: 100%; height: auto;">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="section-heading">Recent Degree Recipients</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p><strong>1998 (to date)</strong></p>
                <p><span data-field="recipient_1998_name">{{ recipient_1998_name }}</span>, <span data-field="recipient_1998_degree">{{ recipient_1998_degree }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="recipient_1998_name_2">{{ recipient_1998_name_2 }}</span>, <span data-field="recipient_1998_degree_2">{{ recipient_1998_degree_2 }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="recipient_1998_name_3">{{ recipient_1998_name_3 }}</span>, <span data-field="recipient_1998_degree_3">{{ recipient_1998_degree_3 }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">The Physics Learning Center</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>G019 Fisher Hall, Phone <span data-field="center_phone">{{ center_phone }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="plc_description">{{ plc_description }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="plc_availability">{{ plc_availability }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Society of Physics Students - MTU Chapter</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="sps_chapter_description">{{ sps_chapter_description }}</span>
                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">Membership to the Michigan Technological Univer-</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Facilities</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p><span data-field="facility_list">{{ facility_list }}</span></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">Aside from the observatory, these facilities are all located in Fisher Hall.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="section-heading">Physics News</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="address_line_2">{{ address_line_2 }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="address_line_3">{{ address_line_3 }}</span></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 20px;">CHANGE SERVICE REQUESTED</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">To receive Physics News:</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p><span data-field="subscription_instruction">{{ subscription_instruction }}</span></p>
                <form style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <label>Name</label><br>
                    <input type="text" style="width: 100%;"><br><br>
                    <label>Title</label><br>
                    <input type="text" style="width: 100%;"><br><br>
                    <label>Company Name</label><br>
                    <input type="text" style="width: 100%;"><br><br>
                    <label>Address</label><br>
                    <input type="text" style="width: 100%;"><br><br>
                    <label>City</label><input type="text" style="width: 30%;"><label>State</label><input type="text" style="width: 30%;"><label>Zip</label><input type="text" style="width: 30%;">
                </form>
                <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Fax to the Physics Department at <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span> or e-mail <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Did you know...</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <span data-field="did_you_know_fact_1">{{ did_you_know_fact_1 }}</span>
                <p style="margin-top: 15px;">that alumni of the Department of Physics at MTU have supplied the highest per capita support for the Tech Fund in 1997-98 within the College of Sciences and Arts?</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <div class="sub-heading">Faculty Spotlight</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>Robert S. Weidman<br>
                Associate Professor, PhD<br>
                University of Illinois, 1980<br>
                Physics Education</p>
                <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Faculty Photo" style="width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 15px 0;">
                <p style="font-style: italic;">"The physics and applied physics undergraduate degree programs tradition-ally attract the best and brightest students at Michi-gan Tech. It's always a pleasure for me to teach and advise those students who accept the challenge of an intellectually stimulating and rigorous program of study."</p>
                <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">- <span data-field="weidman_email">{{ weidman_email }}</span></p>
                <p style="text-align: right; font-size: 10pt;">Distinguished Teacher Award, 1987</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>